OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash was 'source
OL,4,Aof pure delight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a motorcyclist who died
OL,7,Fin a crash involving a car have said he
OL,8,Fwas a "source of pure delight".
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FNarborough Road South in Leicester, at
OL,12,F14:40 BST on 30 September, to reports
OL,13,Fof a crash involving a grey Kawasaki
OL,14,FZX10 and a red Tesla Model 3.
OL,16,FMathew Mitchell, 57, from Sapcote in
OL,17,FLeicestershire, was pronounced dead at
OL,18,Fthe scene, Leicestershire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
