OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash was 'source
OL,4,Aof pure delight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis wife Diana said he was the "heart
OL,7,Fof our family", and added: "We will
OL,8,Fmiss him every single day, but we will
OL,9,Fcarry his spirit with us always."
